---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: SELECT t.a FROM t JOIN u ON t.a = u.a WHERE u.a = 5
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (a#0 == a#3)
   :- Filter (isnotnull(a#0) and (a#0 == 5))
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
   +- Filter (isnotnull(a#3) and (a#3 == 5))
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
